@startuml
title UC02-05 OperationRequest - idempotency lifecycle (REVIEW)
[*] --> PROCESSING : claim caller + operation + requestId\ncanonical content
PROCESSING --> SUCCEEDED : business effect and result committed
PROCESSING --> FAILED : terminal business rejection committed
SUCCEEDED --> Tombstone : full result retention elapsed
FAILED --> Tombstone : full result retention elapsed
PROCESSING --> PROCESSING : recover technical failure / verify unknown commit
note right of PROCESSING
 Same content: return current status, no second effect.
 Different content: conflict, preserve original.
 HTTP timeout is observation UNKNOWN, not a DB terminal state.
 No processing purge; recovery has bounded retries/ownership checks.
end note
note right of Tombstone
 Monetary UC02/04/05 replay30days.
 Cancellation UC03 replay7days.
 Retain fingerprint/outcome summary in demo.
 Old key never becomes new operation.
end note
@enduml
